### Requêtes de test (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client). Tout passe par la Gateway (9999).
@gw = http://localhost:9999
@agent = Basic YWdlbnQ6YWdlbnQxMjM=
@admin = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### Config Server
GET http://localhost:8888/client-service/default

### Répartition de charge : le port change si plusieurs instances tournent
GET {{gw}}/client-service/api/info

### 1. Créer un client
POST {{gw}}/client-service/api/clients
Authorization: {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Kabre", "prenom": "Awa", "dateNaissance": "1990-05-01", "genre": "FEMININ",
  "adresse": { "rue": "12 rue du Marche", "ville": "Ouagadougou", "pays": "Burkina Faso" },
  "email": "awa@mail.com", "telephones": ["+22670000000"],
  "numeroPieceIdentite": "CNIB123456",
  "permisConduire": { "numero": "P-001", "categorie": "B", "dateObtention": "2012-01-15" },
  "situationFamiliale": "MARIE", "profession": "Ingenieure"
}

### 2. Créer un contrat (clientId = id retourné ci-dessus ; adapter les dates)
POST {{gw}}/contrat-service/api/contrats
Authorization: {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1, "typeContrat": "TOUS_RISQUES", "dateDebut": "2026-10-01", "dateFin": "2027-09-30",
  "renouvellementAutomatique": true, "primeAnnuelle": 450000,
  "garanties": [
    { "type": "RESPONSABILITE_CIVILE", "plafond": 100000000 },
    { "type": "DOMMAGES_COLLISION", "plafond": 8000000 },
    { "type": "VOL", "plafond": 6000000 }
  ],
  "franchises": [ { "garantie": "DOMMAGES_COLLISION", "montant": 100000 } ],
  "options": ["ASSISTANCE"]
}

### 3. Enregistrer un véhicule
POST {{gw}}/vehicule-service/api/vehicules
Authorization: {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contratId": 1, "immatriculation": "AB-123-CD", "marque": "Toyota", "modele": "Corolla",
  "anneeFabrication": 2021, "vin": "JTDKB20U093123456", "datePremiereMiseEnCirculation": "2021-03-01",
  "kilometrageDeclare": 42000, "zoneStationnement": "Ouagadougou Centre", "typeGarage": "PRIVE",
  "usagePrincipal": "PERSONNEL", "kilometrageAnnuelEstime": 12000,
  "systemeAlarme": true, "dispositifGeolocalisation": false, "autresEquipements": ["Anti-demarrage"]
}

### 4. Déclarer un sinistre (dateSinistre dans la période du contrat)
POST {{gw}}/sinistre-service/api/sinistres
Authorization: {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contratId": 1, "vehiculeId": 1, "dateSinistre": "2026-10-20", "description": "Collision au carrefour",
  "typeIncident": "COLLISION", "lieu": "Avenue Kwame Nkrumah, Ouagadougou", "montantEstime": 1500000
}

### 5. Suivre le traitement
POST {{gw}}/sinistre-service/api/sinistres/1/statut
Authorization: {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statut": "EN_EXPERTISE", "commentaire": "Expert mandate" }

### Recherches
GET {{gw}}/sinistre-service/api/sinistres?contratId=1
Authorization: {{agent}}

###
GET {{gw}}/sinistre-service/api/sinistres?vehiculeId=1
Authorization: {{agent}}

### Sécurité : sans authentification -> 401
GET {{gw}}/client-service/api/clients

### Sécurité : DELETE réservé à ADMIN (agent -> 403)
DELETE {{gw}}/client-service/api/clients/1
Authorization: {{agent}}

### Actuator (ADMIN) et rafraîchissement de config
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/metrics
Authorization: {{admin}}

###
POST http://localhost:8081/actuator/refresh
Authorization: {{admin}}
